  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/4aaf608442228a98f74f7.png\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager Mod\" width=\"100%\"/>\n\n# MIUI Theme Manager Mod\n\n**The MIUI Themes app with everything unlocked.**\n\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases/latest)\n[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/stargazers)\n\n</div>\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Legacy MIUI project. No longer updated.** It's kept for MIUI 13–14 users. HyperOS users: see [HyperOS Theme Manager Mod](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager).\n\n## Features\n- English themes and the Global server by default\n- Import themes\n- Online AOD, icons and dynamic wallpapers\n- New MIUI widgets and super icons\n- Theme preview fixed\n\n## Requirements\n- MIUI 13–14, Android 11 or newer\n- Magisk\n\n## Installation\n1. Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases/latest).\n2. Flash it in Magisk.\n3. Reboot your device.\n\n## Notes\n- Android 13 Global/CN ROMs: Signature verification must be disabled. Flash [Apk Protection Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Protection-Patch) or [Apk Signature Verification Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Signature-Verification-Patch) first, or use the Core Patch LSPosed module.\n- If you use this in your ROM, please credit Mods Center. Not for paid ROMs.\n\n## Screenshots\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/f7ae3a187835bc78ea32c.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/8f8eefc904c942ec0a560.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/16c8cc5806863695be1e4f3793f54cd0/1d9a1bfdc38053da-a7/s1280x1920/d0d91e93f73265ff75a3ee581d22c7edaf60e9e1.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/acd92855ca888a89d2d20.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/3d3bf9c005bf44f82383d.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/d56113fa2ba65b7140fd5ec89d0a9270/1d9a1bfdc38053da-67/s1280x1920/2c8a3a137e62974bfc4b608d056fa073af7ad624.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/8942fbd97f8534ff141d1.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/fb6cd090665f5b1e8f716bed28d6ef76/1d9a1bfdc38053da-83/s1280x1920/0c34b1f57b3853bd33d9e83616008958ed737f4f.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/3be23dfe1368f352f660a812b70e2c5c/1d9a1bfdc38053da-06/s1280x1920/6c64ec71faf5a234f25ff8b3b7091939dd033a5e.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/aec08df0423a3be84426929f331b7c0c/1d9a1bfdc38053da-c6/s1280x1920/6618490b3e015279dc5a2b2fbc5f2d2a1d244433.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\nMade by **[🅺🅰🆂🅷🅸](https://t.me/kakashi1v1)** · part of **[Mods Center](https://github.com/Mods-Center)**\n\n[Website](https://modscenter.org) · [Channel](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs) · [Support group](https://t.me/bootloop_discussion) · [Report a bug](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/issues)\n\n</div>\n",
  "readmeHTML": "<p><div align=\"center\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/4aaf608442228a98f74f7.png\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager Mod\" width=\"100%\"/></p>\n\n<h1>MIUI Theme Manager Mod</h1>\n\n<p><b>The MIUI Themes app with everything unlocked.</b></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff\">![Release</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases/latest)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158\">![Downloads</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a\">![Stars</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/stargazers)</p>\n\n<p></div></p>\n\n<p>> [!WARNING]</p>\n<p>> <b>Legacy MIUI project. No longer updated.</b> It's kept for MIUI 13–14 users. HyperOS users: see <a href=\"https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager\">HyperOS Theme Manager Mod</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<li>English themes and the Global server by default</li>\n<li>Import themes</li>\n<li>Online AOD, icons and dynamic wallpapers</li>\n<li>New MIUI widgets and super icons</li>\n<li>Theme preview fixed</li>\n\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<li>MIUI 13–14, Android 11 or newer</li>\n<li>Magisk</li>\n\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<li>Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Theme-Manager/releases/latest).</li>\n<li>Flash it in Magisk.</li>\n<li>Reboot your device.</li>\n\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<li>Android 13 Global/CN ROMs: Signature verification must be disabled. Flash [Apk Protection Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Protection-Patch) or [Apk Signature Verification Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Signature-Verification-Patch) first, or use the Core Patch LSPosed module.</li>\n<li>If you use this in your ROM, please credit Mods Center. Not for paid ROMs.</li>\n\n<h2>Screenshots</h2>\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/f7ae3a187835bc78ea32c.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/8f8eefc904c942ec0a560.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/16c8cc5806863695be1e4f3793f54cd0/1d9a1bfdc38053da-a7/s1280x1920/d0d91e93f73265ff75a3ee581d22c7edaf60e9e1.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/acd92855ca888a89d2d20.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/3d3bf9c005bf44f82383d.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/d56113fa2ba65b7140fd5ec89d0a9270/1d9a1bfdc38053da-67/s1280x1920/2c8a3a137e62974bfc4b608d056fa073af7ad624.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://telegra.ph/file/8942fbd97f8534ff141d1.png\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/fb6cd090665f5b1e8f716bed28d6ef76/1d9a1bfdc38053da-83/s1280x1920/0c34b1f57b3853bd33d9e83616008958ed737f4f.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/3be23dfe1368f352f660a812b70e2c5c/1d9a1bfdc38053da-06/s1280x1920/6c64ec71faf5a234f25ff8b3b7091939dd033a5e.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/aec08df0423a3be84426929f331b7c0c/1d9a1bfdc38053da-c6/s1280x1920/6618490b3e015279dc5a2b2fbc5f2d2a1d244433.pnj\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"MIUI Theme Manager\"/></p>\n<p></p></p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<p><div align=\"center\"></p>\n\n<p>Made by <b><a href=\"https://t.me/kakashi1v1\">🅺🅰🆂🅷🅸</a></b> · part of <b><a href=\"https://github.com/Mods-Center\">Mods Center</a></b></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://modscenter.org\">Website</a> · <a href=\"https://t.me/kashis_